			"notes": "## Minecraft versions\n\n| Minecraft | Stardew Fishing Fabric |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1.20.1 | 3.9-fabric |\n| 1.21.1, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2 | 3.8-fabric |\n\n- Synced changes from the corresponding Forge and NeoForge releases, including the 1.20.1 bobber recipes and optional fishing loot, and updated key binding labels and animation timing on recent Minecraft versions.\n- Fixed a 1.21.11 client crash when receiving fishing sound packets. The replacement sounds retain the original volume and pitch. (#15)\n- Restored delivery of live fish after a successful minigame with Fishing Real 1.9.1-backport on 1.20.1. (#10)\n- Tide 2.1.1 hands the complete catch to the Stardew minigame on 1.20.1 and 1.21.1, including additional rewards. (#6)\n- Consolidated the five builds in KltytonTemple with shared sources and assets.\n\nInstall [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) for your Minecraft version. The 1.20.1 and 26.2 downloads also require a separate installation of [Forge Config API Port for Fabric](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port)."
		}
